      "writtenOn": "2023-05-30T06:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This refers to the local proxy server that the phone is starting on localhost. When we first connect to a network with a PAC proxy, we know the PAC URL, but we haven\u0027t started the local server that will interpret the javascript. So the ProxyInfo contains the URL, but it doesn\u0027t yet contain the port on which the local server will start, since it\u0027s not started yet.\n\nLater, that server has started, and we learn on what port it has started. This is when we can fill in the link properties.\n\nAdded detailed comments.",
      "parentUuid": "da37291f_5c9dda39",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11300,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 11300,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "e34c78f4a2a28c69059860a6e36827edab6ab14c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
