      "writtenOn": "2023-05-30T06:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The \"default\" proxy is the proxy for the default network. While calling \"default proxy\" the result of `getProxyForNetwork(null)` might be confusing, it\u0027s also appropriate because it\u0027s the same thing as `ConnectivityManager#getDefaultProxy`.\n\nAdded comments.",
